162
00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:39.518
Question 6.

163
00:16:39.468 --> 00:16:44.843
Which population group gave the party Venstre most of its votes at the end of the 1800s?

164
00:16:44.843 --> 00:16:46.818
Option A: Landowners.

165
00:16:46.818 --> 00:16:48.893
Option B: Workers.

166
00:16:48.893 --> 00:16:51.060
Option C: Farmers.
[DA] Hvilken af følgende befolkningsgrupper fik partiet Venstre flest stemmer fra i slutningen af 1800- tallet?  A: Godsejere  |  B: Arbejdere  |  C: Bønder

167
00:16:57.610 --> 00:16:59.810
The answer is C: Farmers.

168
00:16:59.760 --> 00:17:02.598
It appeared in the June 2021 exam.
[DA] ✔ C: Bønder

169
00:17:03.148 --> 00:17:04.586
Question 7.

170
00:17:04.536 --> 00:17:08.936
Which party did workers typically vote for in the middle of the 1900s?

171
00:17:08.936 --> 00:17:10.973
Option A: Venstre.

172
00:17:10.973 --> 00:17:13.811
Option B: The Social Democrats.

173
00:17:13.811 --> 00:17:16.800
Option C: The Social Liberal Party.
[DA] Hvilket parti stemte arbejdere typisk på i midten af 1900-tallet?  A: Venstre  |  B: Socialdemokratiet  |  C: Radikale Venstre

174
